  "description": "Enter a new era of communication with our mobile app, deploying advanced large language models directly onto your device. Utilizing state-of-the-art AI technology, you can engage in intelligent conversations at your convenience, without depending on the cloud.\n\nMultiple models, endless possibilities.(Llama, Gemma, Qwen, Phi, Mistral)\n\nOur app supports various language models, catering to a wide range of applications and needs. Whether seeking everyday advice, technical discussions, or in-depth academic debates, you can easily switch models and enjoy the most personalized service.\n\nData privacy, security assurance\n\nSecuring your data is our top priority. All data processing and model operations are performed locally, giving you complete control. You can download, delete, or manage your data at any time, ensuring your privacy rights are protected.\n\nSupported devices: iphone 13 pro max or above\n\n\n\n进入一个全新的沟通时代，通过我们的手机App，将先进的大语言模型直接部署到你的设备上。通过先进的AI 技术，无需依赖云端，你可以在任何时候随心所欲地进行智能对话。\n\n多种模型，无限可能。（Llama, Gemma, Qwen, Phi, Mistral）\n\n我们的App支持多种不同的语言模型，涵盖广泛的应用场景和需求。无论是寻找日常建议、技术探讨，还是深度学术讨论，你都可以轻松切换模型，享受到最贴心的服务。\n\n\n数据隐私，安全保障\n\n你的数据安全是我们的首要任务。所有的数据处理和模型运行都在本地完成，你拥有完全的控制权，随时可以下载、删除或管理你的数据，保障你的隐私权利。\n\n支持设备: iphone 13 pro max 或之上",
